  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-31T09:40:54.996Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-31T09:40:54.984Z",
  "id": 203985940183521,
  "uuid": "5e309799-9f62-4063-91f6-71c9c63c8c8f",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "60a60b4f-dfb9-86e2-1fba-49093e6229a6",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "bc5f355c-d9f1-00b8-6306-713c467c2f3c",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The week-long programme served as a powerhouse of knowledge exchange, collaboration, and hands-on learning. Participants immersed themselves in a dynamic array of discussions, and practical sessions meticulously designed to amplify their skills in simulation-based teaching methodologies.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Throughout the programme, attendees delved deep into innovative techniques and best practices, leveraging simulation as a powerful tool for honing clinical skills and fostering a more immersive learning experience for healthcare professionals. These sessions explored diverse facets of simulation-based education, covering topics ranging from scenario development to effective debriefing strategies.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Moreover, the programme offered a platform for networking and sharing insights, allowing attendees to forge meaningful connections, exchange ideas, and cultivate a community dedicated to advancing healthcare education.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The faculty and support teams ensured a stimulating and enriching experience for all participants, facilitating an environment conducive to learning and growth.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Participants left the programme empowered with enriched knowledge, refined skills, and a renewed enthusiasm to integrate innovative simulation techniques into their teaching methodologies. The impact of this programme extends beyond the event itself, as the acquired expertise and insights are set to enhance healthcare education practices across diverse institutions and healthcare settings.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
